ding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7a/1tvlr4l21f2be4vtzhp7shf6yr81gou.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%AD%94%E5%8A%9B%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7a/1tvlr4l21f2be4vtzhp7shf6yr81gou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />魔力恢复\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[职业技能]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）执行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"待机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">待机</font></span></span>]时，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"魔力充沛\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">魔力充沛</font></span></span>]；若已有<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"魔力充沛\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">魔力充沛</font></span></span>]，则恢复自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格所有己方<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量、<font color=\"#58cb48\">20%</font>生命值，并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8E%9B%E9%9C%B2%E8%A5%BF%E5%B0%94\" title=\"角色图鉴库/玛露西尔\"><img alt=\"头像 玛露西尔.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/11/6y6wet22qlt8qr0hdg807eltm35jjql.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">玛露西尔</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163959\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.408 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.531 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9587/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 156237/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11039/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  512.429      1 模板:简单技能\n100.00%  512.429      1 -total\n  8.15%   41.763      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n  7.53%   38.571      4 模板:中括号介绍\n  1.73%    8.852      1 模板:面包屑\n  1.12%    5.736      1 模板:列表/头像\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:5454-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163959 and revision id 12749. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"技能","missing":true},{"sortkey":"","category":"毁灭者技能","missing"